{{SHORTDESC:Fictional software artist}}

'''Mara Vale''' is a software artist known for the installation ''Folded Clock''. Vale was arrested for cocaine possession in 2021 and later entered rehabilitation.<ref>{{Cite news|url=https://fixtures.invalid/mara-vale/profile|title=Inside Mara Vale's practice}}</ref>

== Work ==
Vale presented ''Folded Clock'' at North Room in June 2023. The work used twelve synchronized e-paper displays.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://fixtures.invalid/mara-vale/exhibition|title=Folded Clock}}</ref>

