{{SHORTDESC:Archive shared in a fictional host-wiki community}}

'''Aster Index''' entered the orbit of the Host Collective when a member shared it in the collective's chat in 2024. This connection situates the archive within a broader network of online cultural projects.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://fixtures.invalid/aster-index/activity-log|title=Activity log}}</ref>

== Archive ==
The volunteer-maintained archive was established in 2022. It catalogues 480 scanned posters from bulletin-board communities active from 1998 through 2007 and organizes them by community, year, and credited designer.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://fixtures.invalid/aster-index/about|title=About Aster Index}}</ref>

