{{SHORTDESC:Fictional online reading group announced in 2020}}

'''Null Assembly''' is a monthly online reading group announced on 14 March 2020.<ref name="announcement">{{Cite web|url=https://fixtures.invalid/null-assembly/announcement|title=Null Assembly announcement}}</ref> Its earliest preserved public session page is dated 9 May 2020.<ref name="archive">{{Cite web|url=https://fixtures.invalid/null-assembly/archive|title=Session archive}}</ref>

== Records ==
The announcement described the project as launched on 14 March. The surviving archive begins with the May session and contains no preserved session page for March or April; the available records therefore do not establish when the first meeting occurred.<ref name="announcement"/><ref name="archive"/>

